m]bob-cli-gn[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-gn/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob records attachment origins and ships `bob attachments`[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]origins[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]origins: add the `.bob/attachments/<host>.jsonl` origin journal, have [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`%c` record every attachment it copies, add `bob attachments import` and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`bob attachments origin`, allowlist the journal in the vault, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document the contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Viewer shows the origin, copies it with `y`, restores it with [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]`r`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]viewer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after origins[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]viewer: expose a bob-ledger-tools `attachments` api namespace, then give[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Z viewer an origin line, key-chip footer, toast pill, and the `y` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy and `r` restore gestures, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`Z` on an image-path bullet imports it[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pathz[dim] · [dim][/dim]after origins, viewer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pathz: detect a bullet that holds only an image path, import it through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob, rewrite it to bob's embed in one undoable edit, and open the viewer[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on the new image with an \"Imported\" pill.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gn","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-gn.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-gn.1"},"source_run_id":"run-013573516afed5a3042605b12a27c9eb","started_at":"2026-11-03T19:56:29.545402+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"e404cf06eb79858c9f417aca216a1ac06bff6d456e31853caa84e073fa5121b7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land--mon-1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"212b87a384fa175849a1cff37284ff684e2a3146a3648b0ad12a2e0433e9db59","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land--mon-1/meta.json","size_bytes":673},"state":{"digest":"03da6e6274b0d0b0b75e2420ba82db9b06f849edd1a61868e4943ff7cbcea221","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land--mon-1/state.json","size_bytes":210}},"finished_at":"2026-11-03T23:39:50.880039+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-gn.land--mon-1","local_name":"bob-cli-gn.land--mon-1","metadata":{"agent_session":"bob-cli-gn.land","agent_session_role":"mon-1","bead_id":"bob-cli-gn","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gn","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"mon-1","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-gn.land"},"source_run_id":"run-2b19eccfe18ff3387f1ec7f89b34a1ce","started_at":"2026-11-03T23:36:00.934453+00:00","state":"failed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1793750899,"sha":"dd90f8c781879a2f298127d33a88bf395f6113ca","subject":"fix(attachments): handle wrapped paths and update catalog tests"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"8b6e186b75be63e1a5235458ea10dae2d98ccf0d9acf63fe1e8b98548d374ea4"